['Here is an example of how you might approach this problem using Java 8's Stream API and the MessageDigest class to compute SHA-256 hashes:

```java
import java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets;
import java.security.MessageDigest;
import java.util.*;
import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap;
import java.util.logging.Logger;

public class BatchHashing {
    private static final Logger logger = Logger.getLogger(BatchHashing.class.getName());
    private static Map<String, String> cache = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public List<String> computeHashes(List<String> batch) {
        return batch.parallelStream()
                .map(this::getSHA256)
                .toList();
    }

    private String getSHA256(String input) {
        if (cache.containsKey(input)) {
            logger.info("Cache hit for: " + input);
            return cache.get(input);
        } else {
            try {
                MessageDigest digest = MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256");
                byte[] hashBytes = digest.digest(input.getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8));
                String hexHash = bytesToHex(hashBytes);

                cache.put(input, hexHash);
                logger.info("Computed hash for: " + input);

                return hexHash;
            } catch (Exception e) {
                throw new RuntimeException(e);
            }
        }
    }

    private String bytesToHex(byte[] hashBytes) {
        StringBuilder hexString = new StringBuilder();

        for (byte hashByte : hashBytes) {
            String hex = Integer.toHexString(0xFF & hashByte);

            if (hex.length() == 1) {
                hexString.append('0');
            }

            hexString.append(hex);
        }

        return hexString.toString();
    }
}
```
This code computes the SHA-256 hash of each string in a list using parallel streams to efficiently handle large volumes of requests, storing computed hashes in a ConcurrentHashMap for caching. It also integrates with Java's built-in logging API for request tracing and error handling.
